### get_environment_variable_comptime

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl get_environment_variable_comptime (var : string) : string =\n    run_target_args (fun () => var) function\n        | Rust => fun var =>\n            open rust.rust_operators\n            !\\($'\"option_env\\!(\\\\\\\"\" + !var + \"\\\\\\\").unwrap_or(\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\")\"')\n            |> sm'.ref_to_std_string\n            |> sm'.from_std_string\n        | target => fun _ => null ()","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl get_environment_variable_comptime (var : string) : string =
      run_target_args (fun () => var) function
          | Rust => fun var =>
              open rust.rust_operators
              !\($'"option_env\!(\\\"" + !var + "\\\").unwrap_or(\\\"\\\")"')
              |> sm'.ref_to_std_string
              |> sm'.from_std_string
          | target => fun _ => null ()
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

